rule line_share v1
description "What the other lines of an order come to, line by line. It reads a line's amount and the order's total on a second walk, and makes that an output: once the walk is over it is a value of each line, not one value (E031)"

elements lines
  amount : number  range >=0 <=1000

outputs
  total  : number  round down(1)
  others : number  round down(1)

sum order_total over lines of amount  range >=0 <=100000

define others : number = order_total - amount

define total : number = order_total
